# Full-resolution master artwork for the presenter map (8000x5328). Was a 197 MB PNG, now a
# 14 MB JPEG — still far too heavy to serve or to carry in every clone forever, and a repo
# never gets smaller once a big blob is in its history. The web-sized export the app actually
# loads is public/vendor/route-bg.jpg (2400px, ~780 KB) and IS committed.
# Extension-agnostic on purpose: the master has already changed format once, and a rule naming
# only the old extension silently stops working the moment it does.
Background.*

